Pseudocode: Addition with Unknown # of #s

boolean Done
variable CurrentSum, starts at 0

loop while Done = false
  input number
    if not number, disregard old input and ask again
  number + CurrentSum = CurrentSum
  ask if user wants to input new number Y/N
    if N, end loop

print CurrentSum




Pseudocode: Random Number Generator

variable MaxNumber
variable Result
boolean Again

loop while Again = true
  input number = MaxNumber
    if input invalid, disregard and ask again
  random between 0 and MaxNumber = Result
  print Result
  ask if want to continue Y/N
    if N, Again = False




Pseudocode: Left and Right

variable Input
variable ModResult
variable Left
variable Right
boolean LeftRight (left = true, right = false)

loop 10 times
  generate random number = Input
    if Input = 0
      disregard and generate new number
  mod Input%2 = ModResult
    if ModResult = 1 
      LeftRight = true
      add 1 to Left
    else LeftRight = false
      add 1 to Right

print "Left: variable Left"
print "Right: variable Right"
